        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.098,
            0.165,
            0.579,
            0.184
          ],
          "content": "In this chapter, you have studied the following points :"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.125,
            0.189,
            0.9,
            0.252
          ],
          "content": "**1.** Length of an arc of a sector of a circle with radius r and angle with degree measure   is $\\frac { \\dot { \\boldsymbol { \\theta } } } { 3 6 0 } \\times 2 \\pi r .$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.124,
            0.264,
            0.891,
            0.3
          ],
          "content": "**2.** Area of a sector of a circle with radius r and angle with degree measure   is $\\frac { \\theta } { 3 6 0 } \\times \\pi   r ^ { 2 }$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.124,
            0.311,
            0.829,
            0.353
          ],
          "content": "**3.** Area of segment of a circle = Area of the corresponding sector – Area of the corresponding triangle."
        },
        {
